type: software
title: "Foci: nuclear foci segmentation and analysis"
abstract: >-
  Tools for segmenting nuclei and nuclear foci in fluorescence microscopy
  images, measuring foci morphology and intensity, and comparing experimental
  conditions with multivariate statistics (PCA, UMAP, PERMANOVA).
